 "path": "/2026/05/cargando-supermercados-cash-fresh.html",
 "titulo": "SUPERMERCADOS CASH FRESH",
 "fila": null,
 "contenido": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpwTMK7xgGcz8Hm1G7fFpraxC1AyxbCAjy73SNlOy6opqwaFe0bvgdyGXtOAHSKhU_Cg07bcz8LzVY97AV8QvVKePiKxi9hfHmWvXBe9md49eDGWRFaR-YoZWk4-4C1xpatW-Ub-I4v4s8cg5VStVs1pxFG4sf7ROPPo7_ZETWLzNwtgTUM1d-FczKV0c/s845/hemos-mejorado-para-ti-en-c-lope-de-vega-845x321.jpg\" style=\"display: block; padding: 1em 0; text-align: center; \"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" data-original-height=\"321\" data-original-width=\"845\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpwTMK7xgGcz8Hm1G7fFpraxC1AyxbCAjy73SNlOy6opqwaFe0bvgdyGXtOAHSKhU_Cg07bcz8LzVY97AV8QvVKePiKxi9hfHmWvXBe9md49eDGWRFaR-YoZWk4-4C1xpatW-Ub-I4v4s8cg5VStVs1pxFG4sf7ROPPo7_ZETWLzNwtgTUM1d-FczKV0c/s320/hemos-mejorado-para-ti-en-c-lope-de-vega-845x321.jpg\"/></a></div>\nCash Fresh es una cadena de supermercados andaluza conocida por sus precios competitivos y por destacar en secciones de frescos como carnicería, pescadería y frutería. Muchos clientes valoran la variedad de productos y el trato cercano del personal, especialmente en tiendas de Andalucía, aunque algunas reseñas mencionan colas en caja o diferencias de calidad según el establecimiento. En general, se percibe como una opción práctica para hacer la compra diaria con buenas ofertas y productos frescos.\n<div id=\"cashfresh-widget\">\n  <div id=\"cashfresh-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; color: #333;\">\n    <p style=\"grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; color: #999;\">Cargando supermercados Cash Fresh...</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card { border: 1px solid #eaeaea; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card img { width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card-body { padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex: 1; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #111; margin-bottom: 5px; text-transform: capitalize; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card .cf-folleto { font-size: 12px; color: #e63946; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card .cf-btn { display: block; background: #e63946; color: #fff; padding: 10px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card .cf-btn:hover { background: #c1121f; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card .cf-btn-folleto { background: #fff; color: #e63946; border: 1px solid #e63946; }\n  #cashfresh-widget .cf-card .cf-btn-folleto:hover { background: #fef2f2; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var proxy = \"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbzeMKVUzOXYNngx1d8OMhEF6ebsFmfXa8Iyd9ZOgpBoX4zqvs93rMJuortAtPxnu-2v/exec\";\n  var SITEMAP_URL = \"https://www.cashfresh.es/portfolio-sitemap.xml\";\n\n  function cargarCF() {\n    fetch(proxy + \"?url=\" + encodeURIComponent(SITEMAP_URL))\n      .then(function(res) { return res.text(); })\n      .then(function(xml) {\n        var bloques = xml.split(\"<url>\");\n        bloques.shift();\n        \n        var tiendas = [];\n        bloques.forEach(function(bloque) {\n          var locMatch = bloque.match(/<loc>([^<]+)<\\/loc>/);\n          var imgMatches = bloque.match(/<image:loc>([^<]+)<\\/image:loc>/g);\n          \n          if (locMatch && imgMatches && imgMatches.length >= 1) {\n            var url = locMatch[1];\n            var slug = url.replace(/\\/$/, \"\").split(\"/\").pop();\n            var nombre = slug.replace(/-/g, \" \");\n            var img = imgMatches[0].replace(/<\\/?image:loc>/g, \"\");\n            \n            tiendas.push({\n              nombre: nombre.replace(/\\b\\w/g, function(l) { return l.toUpperCase(); }),\n              url: url,\n              img: img,\n              slug: slug\n            });\n          }\n        });\n\n        var vistos = {};\n        tiendas = tiendas.filter(function(t) {\n          if (vistos[t.url]) return false;\n          vistos[t.url] = true;\n          return true;\n        });\n\n        if (tiendas.length === 0) {\n          document.getElementById(\"cashfresh-grid\").innerHTML =\n            \"<p style='grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; color: #666;'>No se encontraron tiendas.</p>\";\n          return;\n        }\n\n        var html = \"\";\n        tiendas.forEach(function(t) {\n          var urlFolleto = \"https://www.cashfresh.es/folleto-de-\" + t.slug + \"/\";\n          \n          html +=\n            '<div class=\"cf-card\">' +\n            '<img src=\"' + t.img + '\" alt=\"' + t.nombre + '\" loading=\"lazy\">' +\n            '<div class=\"cf-card-body\">' +\n            '<h3>' + t.nombre + '</h3>' +\n            '<a class=\"cf-btn\" href=\"' + t.url + '\" target=\"_blank\">🛒 VER TIENDA</a>' +\n            '<a class=\"cf-btn cf-btn-folleto\" href=\"' + urlFolleto + '\" target=\"_blank\">📖 VER FOLLETO</a>' +\n            '</div>' +\n            '</div>';\n        });\n\n        html +=\n          '<div style=\"grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; padding: 20px;\">' +\n          '<a href=\"https://www.cashfresh.es/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #e63946; color: #fff; padding: 14px 35px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold;\">🛒 VER WEB DE CASH FRESH</a>' +\n          '</div>';\n\n        document.getElementById(\"cashfresh-grid\").innerHTML = html;\n      })\n      .catch(function() {\n        document.getElementById(\"cashfresh-grid\").innerHTML =\n          \"<p style='grid-column: 1/-1; text-align: center; color: red;'>Error al cargar.</p>\";\n      });\n  }\n\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", cargarCF);\n  } else {\n    cargarCF();\n  }\n})();\n</script>",
 "fecha_copia": "2026-10-03T10:12:55.522Z"
}